<section id="data-sharing">
  <h2>
    <span class="section-icon">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
    </span>
    Data Sharing & Disclosure
  </h2>

  <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share your data only in limited circumstances:</p>

  <h3>Service Providers</h3>
  <p>These companies process your data for us so Ferni can work. We don't sell it to them or to anyone else.</p>

  <div class="data-table">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Provider</th>
          <th>What it does for Ferni</th>
          <th>Data it processes</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
