        <tr>
          <td><strong>{{ p.name }}</strong></td>
          <td>{{ p.does }}</td>
          <td>{{ p.data }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p>When you ask for something that needs another service, like finding a place, playing a song or adding to your calendar, we send that service only what the request needs.</p>

  <h3>Legal Requirements</h3>
  <p>We may disclose your information when required by law, including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Valid legal process (subpoenas, court orders, government requests)</li>
    <li>To protect the safety of any person</li>
    <li>To investigate potential violations of our Terms</li>
    <li>To protect our legal rights</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We will notify you of legal requests unless prohibited by law or court order, and we will challenge requests we believe are overly broad or inappropriate.</p>

  <h3>Business Transfers</h3>
  <p>If Ferni is involved in a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets, your information may be transferred. We will notify you via email and/or prominent notice on our website of any change in ownership and your choices regarding your information.</p>

  <h3>With Your Consent</h3>
  <p>We may share information for other purposes with your explicit consent.</p>
</section>

<section id="data-retention">
  <h2>
    <span class="section-icon">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
    </span>
    Data Retention
  </h2>

  <p>We keep your conversations and the things you tell Ferni for as long as you have an account, because that's how Ferni remembers you. Deleting your account erases them. How long we keep every other kind of data is in <a href="#at-a-glance">Your Data at a Glance</a>.</p>

  <h3>Deleting Your Account</h3>
  <p>In the app, open the menu and choose <strong>Privacy &amp; your data</strong>, then <strong>Delete my account</strong>. You can download a copy of your data there first. Deleting your account erases your conversations, memories, profile and the records linked to them right away, and closes your sign-in. We keep a record that you asked for the deletion, for security. Usage analytics aren't erased yet (see above). You can also email <a href="mailto:privacy@ferni.ai">privacy@ferni.ai</a> and we'll do it for you.</p>
</section>

<section id="data-security">
  <h2>
    <span class="section-icon">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
    </span>
    Data Security
  </h2>

  <p>Here's what protects your information today. We only list what we can check.</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Encrypted in transit:</strong> your device talks to Ferni over encrypted connections (TLS).</li>
    <li><strong>Encrypted at rest:</strong> what we keep is stored on Google Cloud, which encrypts it at rest with AES-256 (<a href="https://docs.cloud.google.com/docs/security/encryption/default-encryption">Google's description</a>).</li>
    <li><strong>Few hands:</strong> only a few named people on the Ferni team can reach production data, through Google Cloud's access controls. Everyone on the team signs in to our code on GitHub with two-step sign-in.</li>
    <li><strong>Every code change is checked:</strong> automated code scanning (GitHub CodeQL) reviews every proposed change, Dependabot flags and patches vulnerable dependencies, and secret scanning blocks passwords and keys from being committed.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>If Something Goes Wrong</h3>
  <p>If a breach affects your personal information, we'll tell you promptly by email or in the app, and we'll notify regulators where the law requires it (under GDPR, within 72 hours of learning about it).</p>
</section>

<section id="international-transfers">
  <h2>
    <span class="section-icon">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
